@startuml Teacher's Teammate — One file in a run
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFDD
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888888

title FileProcessor.process(file)

start
:Prepare the cache
hash the file, load its stored state,
compare with the settings and the teacher's work,
reset what is stale;

if (reading stored and fresh?) then (yes)
  :Use the stored reading;
else (no)
  :Prepare the pages (PreprocessService);
  if (text file, or PDF with a usable text layer?) then (yes)
    :The text is the reading;
  elseif (text recognition switched off?) then (yes)
    #FFE0B2:Result: **skipped**;
    stop
  else (scans)
    :Read the pages (OCRStageService);
    :Normalise the notation
    (OcrOutputPostprocessor);
  endif
  :Store the reading;
endif

:Take the texts the document has now
the teacher's text where it applies;

if (proofreading on, result not fresh?) then (yes)
  :Hide personal info (optional, once per text);
  :Proofread (Corrector)
  in pieces when the text is long;
  :Put names back, check the review fits;
  :Store the proofreading;
endif

if (content review on, result not fresh?) then (yes)
  :Review the content (Evaluator);
  :Store the review;
endif

:Write the outputs
Word file, text files;
#C8E6C9:Result: **done**
(with warnings when a step fell back);
stop

note right
  At any step:
  * StageError → **failed**: this file ends,
    the next file runs
  * Stop requested → **stopped**: neither
    success nor failure
  Both keep everything the earlier
  steps already stored.
end note
@enduml
